    <meta name="description" content="
     Disclosed herein is a multi-layer, microporous polyolefin membrane comprising a first porous layer of a polyethylene, and a second porous layer comprising a polyethylene, and polypropylene having a weight-average molecular weight of 6×10 5  or more and a fraction having a molecular weight of 1.8×10 6  or more being 10% or more by mass. 
   
   ">
